<title>UK: CSFB sets call, put warrants on Swiss govt bonds.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets call, put warrants on Swiss govt bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said it has issued a total of two million American-style call and put warrants in two equal tranches, on the 4.50 percent Swiss government bond due June 10, 2007.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 10.MAR.97-21.AUG.97   PAYDATE	07.MAR.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  108.50 PCT		MIN EXER LOT 100 * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	 STRIKE	 ISSUE     PREMIUM</p>
<p> CALL	    108.50 PCT   1.16 CHF  2.34 PCT</p>
<p>  PUT	    106.50 PCT   1.28 CHF  1.89 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
